+/*
+ * Moves a PIN that has just been checked the v0.1.0 way into the secure element: new slot
+ * secret, its DEK file wrapped again with it, record in the SE format. PW1/PW3/RC go through
+ * pin_txn, so a power cut leaves either the old state (and the next correct PIN moves it again) or
+ * a journal that the next correct PIN completes. If the DEK of this PIN cannot be opened with it,
+ * the PIN stays in flash.
